    "body": "Thank you for this clear proposal.\n\nTriage: **P6** (accepted enhancement), **effort:high**, **area:post**, **area:ui**. It touches the machine-file format, its validation, the post offer and the shipped machine files, so it gets the safety-level review. Your rules keep the safe behaviour: a mount never changes the post by itself, and the change goes through the existing undoable post command.\n\nIf you take it on, please comment `claimed:` with your plan, as on #2358.\n",
